 "text": "## Best practices\n\n### Do\n\n- Use Text whenever you need to display stylized text\n- Use Text to display read-only text\n- Use the `as` prop to give the text a semantic meaning. By default, the Text component will result in a `span` element.",
 "format": "md"
 }
